<title>SPAIN: Spain's Rato ends initial budget briefing.</title>
<headline>Spain's Rato ends initial budget briefing.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Economy Minister Rodrigo Rato finished  on Friday an initial presentation on the outline of the 1998 budget  following the regular cabinet meeting.</p>
<p>He gave an indication of imports, exports and expenditures.</p>
<p>The budget must be approved by the cabinet and presented to the legislature  by the end of September.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
